          "level": 2,
          "text": "278 repository example modules"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Every TypeScript file in examples/demos is represented here with its authored description, walkthrough, experiments, related APIs and detected runtime requirements. The 271 modules that export scenes run in an editable playground; the seven supporting modules display their source without a play control. Use [Focused scene examples](/focused-examples) when you want a smaller scene with one learning goal."
